# dist IS committed. The cPanel server cannot run Chrome, so react-snap
# prerendering only works on a developer machine - the built HTML has to
# reach the server through git.
#
# dist/assets is NOT committed. Those are the same images that already
# live in public/assets and are already on the server in public_html/assets.
# Committing them twice would push the repo past 350 MB.
dist/assets/

